WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.880
This film talks about adventures that we’d like to have.

2
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.440
I’d love to go on a spaceship to the moon. 

3
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.400
What adventure would you like to have?

4
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.040
I would love to go to Brazil.

5
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.640
I’d love to go to America.

6
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.400
What adventure would you like to have?

7
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.320
I would love to go skydiving.

8
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.160
I‘d love to go to America.


9
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.640
And what would you like to fly - in a hot air balloon,

10
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.280
a spaceship or an aeroplane?

11
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.680
I’d like to go on a hot air balloon.

12
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.880
I would like to fly in an aeroplane.

13
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.160
I think I might go on a jet.

14
00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.920
I’d love to fly in a helicopter over Los Angeles.

15
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.680
And where would you like to go?

16
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.200
Definitely Rio.


17
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.160
I would love to visit New York.


18
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.200
I’d like to go over the Grand Canyon in a hot air balloon.


19
00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.080
And who would you like to travel with?


20
00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.960
I’d like to travel with my mum and dad.


21
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:54.640
I’d take my sister.

22
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.480
And who would you like to travel with?


23
00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.120
My friends and family.

24
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.560
I’d like to travel with my brother.
